{"v":4,"catch":"文明的挑戰，外星人的攻擊！ \n升起！ GALAXIAN！","desc":"《GALAXIAN》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1979年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n您控制 GALAXIP 並射擊以怪異曲線接近您的外星人。 外星人在突襲時得分翻倍，旗艦（GALBOSS）可以依次射擊，從護衛隊（RED ALIEN）開始，得分更高。\n巧妙地躲避敵人的外星人並摧毀大隊形。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-11-24","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03b8f28b194fc11f714107cfe7d30faff12f479ecec4c56958289562612df607.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b16cf056241b4ae8b54a3e1c42d31c01398a0288a250dfa738d896ea0c6be84f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d66fd9175b0eb22788a2cf1139b3a0aa2ac62bc7d7e3b2cedd918f3190e5be97.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/35eb35a21d3a725570e8739a5ee9b98338f21c5ebdb0736a99057de198b7c9ae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/006336666c98fad4f64167d6fe07832d00bf3853f4c1ba8e9296bbb6c5754fb0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9731425b5d87e4b0d4cf7f77abcc0f3b2aca2b5ff129573f81710ef5723c8a9b.jpg"],"titleId":"0100854015ace000","dlc":[]}